second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which electoral district is Larré associated with?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 87, \"text\": \"Here is a Wikipedia-style entry that presents comprehensive evidence for the statement:\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 89, \"end\": 94, \"text\": \"Larré\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 96, \"end\": 184, \"text\": \"Larré is a commune in the Orne department in the Normandy region in northwestern France.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 185, \"end\": 208, \"text\": \"Administrative Division\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 210, \"end\": 283, \"text\": \"Larré is associated with the electoral district of the canton of Écouves.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 284, \"end\": 441, \"text\": \"This association is evident in the administrative division of the Orne department, where Larré is one of the 23 communes that comprise the canton of Écouves.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 442, \"end\": 445, \"text\": \"[1]\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 447, \"end\": 629, \"text\": \"According to the French National Institute for Statistics and Economic Studies (INSEE), Larré is part of the canton of Écouves, which is one of the 21 cantons of the Orne department.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 630, \"end\": 815, \"text\": \"[2] This classification is based on the French administrative system, where communes are grouped into cantons, which are then grouped into arrondissements, and finally into departments.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 816, \"end\": 943, \"text\": \"The canton of Écouves is a canton of France located in the Orne department, and it is composed of 23 communes, including Larré.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 944, \"end\": 1052, \"text\": \"[3] The canton is named after the Écouves forest, which covers a significant part of the canton's territory.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1053, \"end\": 1064, \"text\": \"References:\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1066, \"end\": 1090, \"text\": \"[1] \\\"Canton of Écouves\\\".\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1091, \"end\": 1161, \"text\": \"French National Institute for Statistics and Economic Studies (INSEE).\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1162, \"end\": 1183, \"text\": \"Retrieved 2023-02-20.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1184, \"end\": 1206, \"text\": \"[2] \\\"Orne department\\\".\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1207, \"end\": 1277, \"text\": \"French National Institute for Statistics and Economic Studies (INSEE).\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1278, \"end\": 1299, \"text\": \"Retrieved 2023-02-20.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1300, \"end\": 1324, \"text\": \"[3] \\\"Canton of Écouves\\\".\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1325, \"end\": 1335, \"text\": \"Wikipedia.\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1336, \"end\": 1357, \"text\": \"Retrieved 2023-02-20.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 5, \"text\": \"Larré\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 7, \"end\": 95, \"text\": \"Larré is a commune in the Orne department in the Normandy region in northwestern France.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 96, \"end\": 114, \"text\": \"Electoral District\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 116, \"end\": 217, \"text\": \"Larré is associated with the electoral district of Canton of La Région Limouxine, a canton of France.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 218, \"end\": 358, \"text\": \"This association was established in 2015, following a series of studies and reforms aimed at reorganizing the electoral districts of France.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 359, \"end\": 378, \"text\": \"Studies and Reforms\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 380, \"end\": 562, \"text\": \"In 2012, the French National Assembly launched a comprehensive study on the electoral districts of France, with the goal of improving the representation of rural communes like Larré.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 563, \"end\": 753, \"text\": \"The study, led by the French Ministry of the Interior, concluded that the existing electoral districts were inefficient and did not accurately reflect the demographic changes in rural areas.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 754, \"end\": 890, \"text\": \"In response to the study's findings, the French government introduced a series of reforms aimed at reorganizing the electoral districts.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 891, \"end\": 1021, \"text\": \"The reforms, which were implemented in 2015, resulted in the creation of new cantons, including the Canton of La Région Limouxine.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1022, \"end\": 1147, \"text\": \"The Canton of La Région Limouxine was established by decree on February 17, 2015, and comprises 15 communes, including Larré.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1148, \"end\": 1258, \"text\": \"The canton is part of the Orne department and is represented by two councilors in the General Council of Orne.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1259, \"end\": 1269, \"text\": \"References\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1271, \"end\": 1383, \"text\": \"* \\\"Rapport sur la réforme des cantons\\\" (Report on the Reform of Cantons), French Ministry of the Interior, 2012.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1384, \"end\": 1498, \"text\": \"* \\\"Décret n° 2015-172 du 17 février 2015 portant sur la création des cantons du département de l'Orne\\\" (Decree No.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1499, \"end\": 1632, \"text\": \"2015-172 of February 17, 2015, on the Creation of Cantons in the Orne Department), Journal Officiel de la République Française, 2015.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1633, \"end\": 1768, \"text\": \"* \\\"La Région Limouxine: un nouveau canton pour l'Orne\\\" (La Région Limouxine: A New Canton for Orne), Le Courrier de l'Orne, March 2015.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Larré\", \"scope\": \"electoral district\", \"claim\": \"Larré is associated with the electoral district of Canton of La Région Limouxine, a canton of France.\", \"answer\": \"Canton of La Région Limouxine\", \"quote\": \"Larré is associated with the electoral district of Canton of La Région Limouxine, a canton of France.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"canton of Écouves\", \"Canton of La Région Limouxine\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"canton of Écouves\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Canton of La Région Limouxine\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
